Note: the easing helper ui_ease_in_out is an integer port of LVGL's
lv_anim_path_ease_in_out (LVGL is MIT-licensed, https://lvgl.io).

Font bitmap tables (ui/src/font_data*.c, ui/src/song_data.c) are NOT part of
this repository: historical tables were rasterized from commercial fonts and
are excluded via .gitignore. Generate them locally (see CONTRIBUTING.md),
preferably from open-licensed fonts: ZCOOL QingKe HuangYou (OFL) for display,
Noto Sans SC / Source Han Sans (OFL) for CJK, Inter (OFL) for ASCII. Tables
rasterized from such OFL fonts may be committed safely. They are not covered
by the MIT grant above until you supply them under their own font license.